{"5148200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ashes Of The Fallen", "steam_appid": 5148200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️Ashes of the Fallen⚔️</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashes of the Fallen</strong> is a 2D action hack-and-slash RPG </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where every battle brings you one step closer to challenging a god.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖The Story<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/eb6183bba76364081d8ab9ed6bbcb520.poster.avif?t=1788262373\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/eb6183bba76364081d8ab9ed6bbcb520.webm?t=1788262373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/eb6183bba76364081d8ab9ed6bbcb520.mp4?t=1788262373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur is a warrior who dared to fight the <strong>God of Time</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As punishment, the God of Time cast Arthur into the deepest dungeon—a place filled with monsters, forgotten warriors, and enemies that should have remained buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/6a159308ca823c52e080800ede70aa9f.poster.avif?t=1788262373\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/6a159308ca823c52e080800ede70aa9f.webm?t=1788262373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/6a159308ca823c52e080800ede70aa9f.mp4?t=1788262373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Arthur refuses to die there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the depths and carve your path toward the surface. Along the journey, Arthur will face <strong>Vanel</strong>, an old opponent from his past, and uncover a path forward with the help of <strong>Sylvane</strong>, his friend, mentor, and trainer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every battle, Arthur grows stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every floor, he gets closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at the top of the dungeon awaits the one enemy he came here to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The God of Time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat her, take her crown, and claim the power to make a single wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But after everything Arthur has sacrificed to reach the top...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will he wish for?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/1989ba8dddb56c216f1e32cb9cdb9f66.poster.avif?t=1788262373\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/1989ba8dddb56c216f1e32cb9cdb9f66.webm?t=1788262373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/1989ba8dddb56c216f1e32cb9cdb9f66.mp4?t=1788262373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥Fight Your Way Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Fast-paced 2D hack-and-slash combat</strong><br>🔥 <strong>Battle through dangerous enemies and powerful foes</strong><br>🏰 <strong>Climb from the deepest dungeon toward the surface</strong><br>🩸 <strong>Face old enemies and uncover Arthur's past</strong><br>💀 <strong>Challenge powerful encounters and bosses</strong><br>👑 <strong>Reach the God of Time and fight for her crown</strong><br>✨ <strong>Claim the power of a wish</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashes of the Fallen</strong> is a journey of revenge, survival, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon awaits.✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise from the ashes.</strong>🔥</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️Ashes of the Fallen⚔️</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashes of the Fallen</strong> is a 2D action hack-and-slash RPG </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where every battle brings you one step closer to challenging a god.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖The Story<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/eb6183bba76364081d8ab9ed6bbcb520.poster.avif?t=1788262373\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/eb6183bba76364081d8ab9ed6bbcb520.webm?t=1788262373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/eb6183bba76364081d8ab9ed6bbcb520.mp4?t=1788262373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur is a warrior who dared to fight the <strong>God of Time</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As punishment, the God of Time cast Arthur into the deepest dungeon—a place filled with monsters, forgotten warriors, and enemies that should have remained buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/6a159308ca823c52e080800ede70aa9f.poster.avif?t=1788262373\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/6a159308ca823c52e080800ede70aa9f.webm?t=1788262373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/6a159308ca823c52e080800ede70aa9f.mp4?t=1788262373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Arthur refuses to die there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the depths and carve your path toward the surface. Along the journey, Arthur will face <strong>Vanel</strong>, an old opponent from his past, and uncover a path forward with the help of <strong>Sylvane</strong>, his friend, mentor, and trainer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every battle, Arthur grows stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every floor, he gets closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at the top of the dungeon awaits the one enemy he came here to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The God of Time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat her, take her crown, and claim the power to make a single wish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But after everything Arthur has sacrificed to reach the top...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will he wish for?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/1989ba8dddb56c216f1e32cb9cdb9f66.poster.avif?t=1788262373\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/1989ba8dddb56c216f1e32cb9cdb9f66.webm?t=1788262373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/extras/1989ba8dddb56c216f1e32cb9cdb9f66.mp4?t=1788262373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥Fight Your Way Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Fast-paced 2D hack-and-slash combat</strong><br>🔥 <strong>Battle through dangerous enemies and powerful foes</strong><br>🏰 <strong>Climb from the deepest dungeon toward the surface</strong><br>🩸 <strong>Face old enemies and uncover Arthur's past</strong><br>💀 <strong>Challenge powerful encounters and bosses</strong><br>👑 <strong>Reach the God of Time and fight for her crown</strong><br>✨ <strong>Claim the power of a wish</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashes of the Fallen</strong> is a journey of revenge, survival, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon awaits.✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rise from the ashes.</strong>🔥</p>", "short_description": "Ashes of the Fallen is a 2D action hack and slash RPG. Play as Arthur, a fallen warrior fighting his way out of the deepest dungeon. Battle deadly enemies, grow stronger, and rise to challenge the God of Time. Claim her crown and make one wish.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/4bde9fbcb900a6b7a8e98369d98a9b9c72e4cb89/header.jpg?t=1788262373", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/68ee9eab2bf023181f2d42c118214e359d483490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788262373", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5148200/68ee9eab2bf023181f2d42c118214e359d483490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788262373", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics supporting DirectX 10<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Ve